  "description": "<h1>SPT - Keycard Door Breach</h1>\n<p>A SPT BepInEx plugin for Doors:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Simplifies keycard doors by removing card selection, allowing the “breach” option directly.</li>\n<li>Adds a toggle to force any “Door Breach” to have 100% success.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5>Only one checkbox in the F12 menu:</h5>\n<ul>\n<li>Enable or disable 100% Door Breach success.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>How to Install</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Download the zip package, open it and drag the ‘‘BepInEx’’ folder to merge into your main folder of EFT. The final DLL should locate at “Your SPT path\\BepInEx\\plugins\\KeycardDoorSimplify.dll”</li>\n<li>To uninstall, just delete the DLL file in that path.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Compatibility</h2>\n<p>This mod will downgrade keycard doors to normal doors, so any mod adding new features to doors will also happened to keycard doors (Like lock picking, sprint breaching)</p>\n<h5>Idea credit to <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://sns.oddba.cn/45242.html\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Doors ClientMods</a> by woohooFly on ODDBA forum.</h5>\n",
